Package: calendar-busy-sync
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-requests (>= 2.31), python3-google-auth-oauthlib (>= 1.0), python3-msal (>= 1.24), cron
Description: local anonymous busy-time mirroring between calendars
 Copies unavailable intervals between Google Calendar and Outlook as private
 Busy appointments. Includes interactive setup, manual sync and opt-in cron.
 Installation never authenticates accounts, writes calendar events or enables cron.
